&lt;h5 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(重要な会計方針)&lt;/span&gt;
